From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dexuan Cui <decui@microsoft.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Aug 2023 01:00:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] UBUNTU: SAUCE: x86/EISA: Don't probe EISA bus for a TDX VM
 (with the paravisor) on Hyper-V

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2052519

Hyper-V hasn't emulated this MMIO access yet for a TDX VM with the
pavavisor: in such a VM, the "readl(p)" causes a soft lockup.

Don't probe EISA bus for such a VM for now.

Signed-off-by: Dexuan Cui <decui@microsoft.com>
Signed-off-by: Tim Gardner <tim.gardner@canonical.com>
Acked-by: Ian May <ian.may@canonical.com>
Acked-by: Marcelo Cerri <marcelo.cerri@canonical.com>
Signed-off-by: Tim Gardner <tim.gardner@canonical.com>
Signed-off-by: Paolo Pisati <paolo.pisati@canonical.com>
Ledger-Change: C-00825
Ledger-Origin: azure@3309527bed511907fdea0d0365425ccc575c0337
---
 arch/x86/kernel/eisa.c | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/x86/kernel/eisa.c b/arch/x86/kernel/eisa.c
index 9535a6507db7..4af4f4654e89 100644
--- a/arch/x86/kernel/eisa.c
+++ b/arch/x86/kernel/eisa.c
@@ -9,6 +9,8 @@
 
 #include <xen/xen.h>
 
+extern bool hyperv_paravisor_present;
+
 static __init int eisa_bus_probe(void)
 {
 	u32 *p;
@@ -16,6 +18,14 @@ static __init int eisa_bus_probe(void)
 	if ((xen_pv_domain() && !xen_initial_domain()) || cc_platform_has(CC_ATTR_GUEST_SEV_SNP))
 		return 0;
 
+	/*
+	 * Hyper-V hasn't emulated this MMIO access yet for a TDX VM with
+	 * the pavavisor: in such a VM, the "readl(p)" below causes a
+	 * soft lockup. Work around the issue for now.
+	 */
+	if (hyperv_paravisor_present)
+		return 0;
+
 	p = memremap(0x0FFFD9, 4, MEMREMAP_WB);
 	if (p && *p == 'E' + ('I' << 8) + ('S' << 16) + ('A' << 24))
 		EISA_bus = 1;
